Gain 5 generic talent points and learn a new talent category from one of the below at 1.0 mastery, unlocked. Group 1 categories are available to anyone; Group 2 are not available to magic users, and Group 3 are not available to antimagic characters.

GROUP 1:

*  Cunning / Scoundrel
*  Cunning / Survival
*  Technique / Conditioning

GROUP 2:

*  Psionic / Augmented mobility
*  Psionic / Dreaming
*  Psionic / Feedback
*  Wild-gift / Call of the wild
*  Wild-gift / Mindstar mastery

GROUP 3:

*  Celestial / Chants
*  Chronomancy / Chronomancy
*  Corruption / Curses
*  Spell / Divination
*  Spell / Staff combat
*  Spell / Stone alchemy
